{"4244990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eskadrila X - Rift Protocol", "steam_appid": 4244990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save Earth. Survive the invasion. Rewrite humanity’s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eskadrila X - Rift Protocol</strong> is our modern take on classic arcade shooters — fast, intense, and built for pure fun. You’ll pilot a high-speed recon ship through alien swarms in fully 3D environments, switching between dynamic <strong>chase</strong> and <strong>top-down</strong> views for the perfect mix of nostalgia and action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2157. Humanity’s first deep-space mission turns into a desperate fight for survival when an alien signal lures our ships into a deadly trap. As Earth’s last surviving pilot, you must battle wave after wave of enemy ships, upgrade your weapons, and face massive boss encounters that test your skill and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple - <strong>defend humanity, one alien wave at a time</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/c4eaae77c9014460bd31664ddaae0c6a.poster.avif?t=1775728848\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/c4eaae77c9014460bd31664ddaae0c6a.webm?t=1775728848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/c4eaae77c9014460bd31664ddaae0c6a.mp4?t=1775728848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eskadrila X - Rift Protocol</strong> combines the simplicity of classic arcade shooters with the depth of modern 3D action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control your ship’s movement left and right, dodging incoming fire and navigating through enemy formations, while using a targeting crosshair - <strong>controlled by your mouse or gamepad</strong> - to lock on and fire at alien ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each encounter is fast-paced and skill-driven, challenging you to balance precision aiming, quick reflexes, and smart positioning. As you progress, you’ll earn resources to upgrade your weapons, shields, and special abilities, preparing for tougher waves and massive boss battles that push your piloting skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer the <strong>cinematic chase camera</strong> or the <strong>classic top-down view</strong>, every fight delivers that satisfying arcade rush - reimagined in full 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/f1c8194ccdcd84362aec77d99bfdb7e0.poster.avif?t=1775728848\" aria-label=\"Image showing gameplay.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/f1c8194ccdcd84362aec77d99bfdb7e0.webm?t=1775728848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/f1c8194ccdcd84362aec77d99bfdb7e0.mp4?t=1775728848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Dynamics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory makes you stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clear enemy waves, you’ll earn upgrade points that can be spent to enhance your ship - boosting <strong>firepower</strong>, <strong>armor</strong>, and <strong>more</strong>. These upgrades don’t just make survival easier - they change how you play, letting you experiment with different builds and strategies as the alien threat intensifies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The result is a constantly evolving gameplay experience where every level feels more powerful, faster, and more intense than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/76661c5b860848342880269f41e5331d.poster.avif?t=1775728848\" aria-label=\"Image showing ship upgrades screen.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/76661c5b860848342880269f41e5331d.webm?t=1775728848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/76661c5b860848342880269f41e5331d.mp4?t=1775728848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Progress &amp; Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress as you play, unlock ship upgrades, and chase higher scores as you master each level. Your achievements and leaderboard rankings are tied to your Steam account, letting you compete with players around the world for the top spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect your runs, climb the leaderboards, and prove your skills as an elite pilot — every score counts, and every run is a chance to do better.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save Earth. Survive the invasion. Rewrite humanity’s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eskadrila X - Rift Protocol</strong> is our modern take on classic arcade shooters — fast, intense, and built for pure fun. You’ll pilot a high-speed recon ship through alien swarms in fully 3D environments, switching between dynamic <strong>chase</strong> and <strong>top-down</strong> views for the perfect mix of nostalgia and action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2157. Humanity’s first deep-space mission turns into a desperate fight for survival when an alien signal lures our ships into a deadly trap. As Earth’s last surviving pilot, you must battle wave after wave of enemy ships, upgrade your weapons, and face massive boss encounters that test your skill and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple - <strong>defend humanity, one alien wave at a time</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/c4eaae77c9014460bd31664ddaae0c6a.poster.avif?t=1775728848\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/c4eaae77c9014460bd31664ddaae0c6a.webm?t=1775728848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/c4eaae77c9014460bd31664ddaae0c6a.mp4?t=1775728848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eskadrila X - Rift Protocol</strong> combines the simplicity of classic arcade shooters with the depth of modern 3D action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control your ship’s movement left and right, dodging incoming fire and navigating through enemy formations, while using a targeting crosshair - <strong>controlled by your mouse or gamepad</strong> - to lock on and fire at alien ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each encounter is fast-paced and skill-driven, challenging you to balance precision aiming, quick reflexes, and smart positioning. As you progress, you’ll earn resources to upgrade your weapons, shields, and special abilities, preparing for tougher waves and massive boss battles that push your piloting skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer the <strong>cinematic chase camera</strong> or the <strong>classic top-down view</strong>, every fight delivers that satisfying arcade rush - reimagined in full 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/f1c8194ccdcd84362aec77d99bfdb7e0.poster.avif?t=1775728848\" aria-label=\"Image showing gameplay.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/f1c8194ccdcd84362aec77d99bfdb7e0.webm?t=1775728848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/f1c8194ccdcd84362aec77d99bfdb7e0.mp4?t=1775728848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Dynamics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory makes you stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clear enemy waves, you’ll earn upgrade points that can be spent to enhance your ship - boosting <strong>firepower</strong>, <strong>armor</strong>, and <strong>more</strong>. These upgrades don’t just make survival easier - they change how you play, letting you experiment with different builds and strategies as the alien threat intensifies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The result is a constantly evolving gameplay experience where every level feels more powerful, faster, and more intense than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/76661c5b860848342880269f41e5331d.poster.avif?t=1775728848\" aria-label=\"Image showing ship upgrades screen.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/76661c5b860848342880269f41e5331d.webm?t=1775728848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/extras/76661c5b860848342880269f41e5331d.mp4?t=1775728848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Progress &amp; Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress as you play, unlock ship upgrades, and chase higher scores as you master each level. Your achievements and leaderboard rankings are tied to your Steam account, letting you compete with players around the world for the top spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect your runs, climb the leaderboards, and prove your skills as an elite pilot — every score counts, and every run is a chance to do better.</p>", "short_description": "A fast-paced 3D rail shooter with photo-realistic UE5 visuals. Destroy enemy waves, upgrade and customize your ship to meet escalating challenges, uncover hidden paths with secret rewards, and blast through fully 3D environments with physics-driven destruction.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/913751ce1dbf62d472b484abb1fcdf2ecaa19145/header.jpg?t=1775728848", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/856135d63f5276c92b1f6059ea53496600afd061/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775728848", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4244990/856135d63f5276c92b1f6059ea53496600afd061/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775728848", "website": "https://xratchetgames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core (Intel i5 / Ryzen 3)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 / RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> N